# Shop order alerts. Leave these blank until the bot is ready.
# The book still saves the order and shows the Cash App button.
#
# 1. In Telegram, open @BotFather and send /newbot.
# 2. Copy the token it gives you into TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN.
# 3. Open @userinfobot and copy the Id number into TELEGRAM_SHOP_CHAT_ID.
# 4. Send any message to your new bot so it is allowed to reply.
# 5. On the live book, set the same two names as Cloudflare Pages secrets.
#
# Cash App checkout uses cashtag $Yellow9859 unless a family admin sets another one.
# The order number is shown so it can be typed into the Cash App note.
# Square access tokens stay in the environment or are encrypted per family.
# Never put a Square access token in the browser or in git.

TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_SHOP_CHAT_ID=
CASH_APP_CASHTAG=
SQUARE_ACCESS_TOKEN=
SQUARE_APPLICATION_ID=
SQUARE_LOCATION_ID=
SQUARE_ENV=
BRAND_NAME=
BRAND_SHORT_NAME=
BRAND_STUDIO_NAME=
BRAND_STUDIO_HANDLE=
BRAND_STUDIO_URL=
BRAND_CHANNEL_ID=
BRAND_DOMAIN=
BRAND_OWNER_EMAIL=
BRAND_ADMIN_EMAILS=
DEFAULT_REGION=
QUICK_SIGNIN=
AUTH_SECRET=
